# Strawberry Fields Forever, refrain (figure 105.2), with a half-measure ("nothing to get") and a
# 6/8 bar ("Strawberry Fields for ..."); the eighth-note pulse holds, so they are written as two- and
# three-beat bars. The vocal starts mid-bar 1, so the felt downbeat is bar 2 ("down").
